sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant DSA as DSA accessionWF publish
  participant PRES as Preservation
  participant AT as Transfer stage (shared NFS mount)
  participant PF as purl-fetcher
  participant DB as purl-fetcher MySQL
  participant FS as /stacks (shared mount)
  participant IMG as Cantaloupe
  participant K as Kafka

  DSA->>PF: GET /v1/purls/:druid (md5s already shelved)
  PF-->>DSA: files_by_md5
  opt file missing from /dor/workspace
    DSA->>PRES: content_to_file
  end
  DSA->>AT: copy new files as UUID names
  DSA->>PF: PUT /v1/purls/:druid (JWT, cocina, file_uploads, version)
  PF->>DB: upsert purl row (if version is newer)
  PF->>FS: move UUID files to content/md5
  PF->>FS: write cocina.N.json, public.N.xml, versions.json
  PF->>FS: delete md5s no version references
  PF->>IMG: POST /tasks PurgeItemFromCache (each new jp2)
  PF-->>DSA: 201 Created
  DSA->>PF: GET /v1/purls/:druid (verify nothing missing)
  Note over DSA,PF: Later in accessionWF: release-initiate starts releaseWF
  DSA->>PF: PUT /v1/purls/:druid/release_tags (index, delete)
  PF->>FS: write versions/meta.json
  PF->>K: produce public JSON to each ever-released target topic
